</span><span begin="01:32.220" end="01:34.290">gangsters </span><span begin="01:34.290" end="01:35.730">do</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.330" end="01:42.990"><span begin="01:39.330" end="01:39.390">My </span><span begin="01:39.390" end="01:41.340">freakness </span><span begin="01:41.340" end="01:41.550">is </span><span begin="01:41.550" end="01:41.820">on </span><span begin="01:41.820" end="01:41.940">the </span><span begin="01:41.940" end="01:42.990">loose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.200" end="01:46.860"><span begin="01:43.200" end="01:43.500">And </span><span begin="01:43.500" end="01:44.880">running</span><span begin="01:44.880" end="01:45.150">, </span><span begin="01:45.150" end="01:45.480">all </span><span begin="01:45.480" end="01:45.990">over </span><span begin="01:45.990" end="01:46.860">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.040" end="01:52.590"><span begin="01:47.040" end="01:47.460">Please </span><span begin="01:47.460" end="01:48.000">take </span><span begin="01:48.000" end="01:49.050">me </span><span begin="01:49.050" end="01:49.290">to </span><span begin="01:49.290" end="01:50.250">places</span><span begin="01:50.250" end="01:50.250">, </span><span begin="01:50.250" end="01:50.430">that </span><span begin="01:50.430" end="01:51.360">nobody</span><span begin="01:51.360" end="01:51.360">, </span><span begin="01:51.360" end="01:52.290">nobody </span><span begin="01:52.290" end="01:52.590">knows</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.590" end="01:55.590"><span begin="01:52.590" end="01:52.800">You </span><span begin="01:52.800" end="01:53.040">got </span><span begin="01:53.040" end="01:53.340">me </span><span begin="01:53.340" end="01:53.610">hooked </span><span begin="01:53.610" end="01:53.820">up </span><span begin="01:53.820" end="01:54.060">on </span><span begin="01:54.060" end="01:54.210">the </span><span begin="01:54.210" end="01:55.590">feeling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:56.430" end="01:59.670"><span begin